le=\"text-align: center\">Their hearts beat as one, bound by a force they believe to be eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Guided by their ambitions, they set off for Valebridge, a joyful city where laughter abounds, and love flourishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Behind the smiles and promises of glory, temptation lurks in the shadows. The dungeon grows deeper, awaiting those who dare to descend, in its relentless pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will she remain faithful to the love she feels... or succumb to the warmth of another's touch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877010/extras/a5f4094ca3454085139477a257721424.avif?t=1761808103\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Caelum, and while you're off to buy equipment, Aria wanders the city. Team up with allies, though not all will have pure intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f More than <strong>100 erotic events</strong>, either in battle, on field or in special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Lust system</strong> that changes dialogues, reactions and Aria's behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>&quot;Sex Event Launcher&quot;</strong> lets you play or preview all content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Rename main characters (Caelum, Aria, ???, ???)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Speed Up</strong> the game with &quot;<strong>Ctrl</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Pause</strong> On-Field event with &quot;<strong>P</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Four endings</strong>: <i>Game Over</i>, <i>Neutral</i>, <i>True Love<